    {"problem": "The third floor of your Crown Point two-and-a-half storey is an oven in July", "solution": "One head in the attic room, one on the second floor and one on the main gives each level its own setting. No more hauling a window unit up three flights of stairs every June."},
    {"problem": "Your Stoney Creek builder furnace and AC are wearing out together", "solution": "That is the cleanest hybrid case we see. A ducted EVOX G3 replaces the AC, takes over heating down to its balance point, and a new two-stage furnace or your existing one backs it up. One outdoor unit, one coil, one warranty."},
